    <li><a href="https://www.sos.ca.gov/notary/forms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Forms, Services, and Fees</a> ($20 apostille; $6 special handling for in-person requests, citing California Government Code section 12195(e))</li>
  </ul>
</Base>
